 "text": "-->\nFS Grain - Grain Marketing\n-->\nGrain Marketing\nToggle Navigation\nCash Bids\nFutures\nAbout Us\nCareers\nCustomer Portal\nHome\nCash Bids\nCash Bids List\nCash Bids Grid\nUSDA Cash Bids\nMarket Data\nMarket Overview\nFutures\nOptions\nCustom Charts\nSpread Charts\nMarket Heat Maps\nStocks\nNews & Commentary\nAg Market Commentary\nInside Futures\nWeather\nLocal Weather\nNOAA Weather\nSign up for Alerts\nResources\nTrading Calendar\nFutures 101\nCommodity Symbols\nFarmer's Almanac\nUSDA Reports\nLocations\nSafety Data Sheets\nContact Us\nContact Your Merchandiser\nContact Your Originator\n-->\nFS Grain Marketing Services\nMARKETING PROGRAMS\n-->\nMARKETING PROGRAMS\nCONTRACT TYPES\nPAYMENT OPTIONS\nCOMMUNICATION\nGROUP AVERAGE PRICE PROGRAM (GAPP)\nGAPP is a program offered by FS GRAIN where enrolled bushels are grouped with other producers’ bushels and priced evenly at the close of every trading day within the program pricing period. At the end of the program, you receive an average price.\nThis program offers an old crop corn option, in addition to new crop options for both corn and soybeans. Additional options include cash, picked-up and HTA (fees apply). Old crop corn trades off the July while new crop trades off the November or December futures.\nAdvantages:\n+ Program is based off of 15 year seasonal futures price charts where the program period is adjusted each year to capture the historical higher price time range.\n+ No charge to enroll bushels.\n+ Various contract options.\n+ Free for Fall delivery.\nRisks:\nThe farmer receives an average price at the end of the program that may differ from current prices that may be higher.\nThe average price of the contract moves less towards the end of the program. However, this is a good thing if prices begin to move lower.\n© 2026 Barchart.com, Inc. All market data is hosted and powered by Barchart .\nInformation presented is provided 'as-is' and solely for informational purposes, not for trading purposes or advice, and is delayed. No representations are made by Barchart as to its informational accuracy or completeness.\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information\nExchange Delays\nBy using this site, you agree to the storage of cookies on your devices for enhanced navigation, site analysis, and Barchart's marketing. Data sharing with social media platforms might occur based on the privacy choices you make on those platforms. For specifics, see our our Privacy Policy .\nAccept",
